# networking-console-plugin

OpenShift Console dynamic plugin for the Networking section.

## Context Files

- [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) -- repo structure, key patterns, review checklist
- [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) -- system design, data flow, dependencies
- [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) -- coding standards, PR process, testing

## Conventions

- Path aliases: `@utils/` = `src/utils/`, `@views/` = `src/views/`, `@styles/` = `src/styles/`
- Import order: React, packages, `@` aliases, relative, styles (`simple-import-sort`)
- Named exports sorted alphabetically (`perfectionist`)
- No `console.log`, no hex colors in SCSS, prefix CSS classes
- i18n namespace: `plugin__networking-console-plugin`
- Data fetching: `useK8sWatchResource` only (no direct API calls)
- Resource URLs: use `getResourceURL()` or `resourcePathFromModel()`
- Lint: `npm run lint` / `npm run lint-fix`
- Test: `npm run test-cypress-headless` (Cypress E2E)
